Package: profdemo
Title: Demonstration Package for C Profiling and Debugging
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Demo", "Author", email = "demo@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides intentionally flawed C routines illustrating common
    performance pitfalls — O(n^2) algorithms, cache-unfriendly memory traversal,
    redundant recomputation — and memory errors (malloc without free) that are
    detectable by Valgrind, Linux perf, and the R-level profvis package.
    Intended as a teaching aid for C-level profiling and debugging inside R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
